# Docker
docker/*.env

# Local secret values retained only for migration/rotation. Remove secrets.env
# after the GitHub App configuration is tested; never commit actual values.
secrets.env

# Private keys. The automation GitHub App's PEM belongs in the `automation`
# environment secret AUTOMATION_APP_PRIVATE_KEY (see .github/AUTOMATION_APP.md),
# never in the tree -- but a downloaded copy lands in the repository root as
# privatekey.pem by default, where `git add --all` would stage it into a public
# repository. Ignored by pattern so that can't happen by accident.
*.pem
*.key

# Home Assistant / HACS
*.log

